{"n": 111, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "111.webp", "text": "All:\n\nLoosen bolts (7 and 8).\nPress in tensioning roller,\nTighten bolt (8).\n\nTake off toothed drive belt.\n\nInstallation:\nThere are different toothed belt versions.\n1. Sprockets with Square Profile:\nA. Square profile with 111 teeth\nB. Square profile with 110 teeth\n{\"Z 127\") with modified spring and\ntensioning roller with code “'Z 127”.\n2. Sprockets with Semi-round Profile:\nA. Semi-round profile with 128 teeth\nB. Semi-round profile with 127 teeth\n(“Z 127\") and tensioning roller with\ncode “Z 127”).\nVersions A must be converted to B***.\nInstall toothed drive belt in opposite direction\nof engine’s turning direction, starting on the\ncrankshaft sprocket.\n\nToothed Drive Belt Assembly:\n1 Camshaft sprocket\n2 Tensioning roller\n\n*** See Service Information of Gr. 11\n\n* 9820-11303\n\nTightening Toothed Drive Belt:\n\nLoosen holt (8) — spring force must move the\ntensioning roller,\n\nCrank engine once in running direction up to\nTDC mark (toothed drive belt tightened on its\nown).\n\nCheck timing (with crankshaft in TDC position\nmark on camshaft sprocket must be precisely\naligned with mark on cylinder head).\n\nTighten tensioner (first bolt (8) and then\n\nbolt (7)).\n\nInstall a label showing date and mileage on the,\ncylinder head cover after finishing work.", "words": [["All:", 0.2573, 0.0696, 0.2746, 0.0809], ["Loosen", 0.2579, 0.0855, 0.2918, 0.0968], ["bolts", 0.2948, 0.0855, 0.3191, 0.0968], ["(7", 0.3227, 0.0849, 0.3318, 0.0975], ["and", 0.3349, 0.0862, 0.3521, 0.0968], ["8).", 0.3556, 0.0849, 0.3688, 0.0981], ["Press", 0.2573, 0.1008, 0.2806, 0.1127], ["in", 0.2842, 0.1008, 0.2928, 0.1121], ["tensioning", 0.2958, 0.1015, 0.3455, 0.1147], ["roller,", 0.3485, 0.1008, 0.3764, 0.1127], ["Tighten", 0.2568, 0.1167, 0.2938, 0.1306], ["bolt", 0.2974, 0.1174, 0.3166, 0.1286], ["(8).", 0.3202, 0.1167, 0.3364, 0.1293], ["Take", 0.2568, 0.1326, 0.2806, 0.1446], ["off", 0.2837, 0.1326, 0.